{
  "id": "PRO.2",
  "number": "2",
  "bookId": "PRO",
  "reference": "Proverbs 2",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PRO 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Learn what I teach you, my child, and never forget what I tell you to do. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Listen to what is wise and try to understand it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yes, beg for knowledge; plead for insight. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Look for it as hard as you would for silver or some hidden treasure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you do, you will know what it means to fear the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and you will succeed in learning about God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " who gives wisdom; from him come knowledge and understanding. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He provides help and protection for those who are righteous and honest. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He protects those who treat others fairly, and guards those who are devoted to him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you listen to me, you will know what is right, just, and fair. You will know what you should do. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You will become wise, and your knowledge will give you pleasure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Your insight and understanding will protect you ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and prevent you from doing the wrong thing. They will keep you away from people who stir up trouble by what they say — ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "those who have abandoned a righteous life to live in the darkness of sin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "those who find pleasure in doing wrong and who enjoy senseless evil, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "unreliable people who cannot be trusted.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You will be able to resist any immoral woman who tries to seduce you with her smooth talk, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "who is faithless to her own husband and forgets her sacred vows. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you go to her house, you are travelling the road to death. To go there is to approach the world of the dead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No one who visits her ever comes back. He never returns to the road to life. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So you must follow the example of good people and live a righteous life. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Righteous people — people of integrity — will live in this land of ours. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But God will snatch the wicked from the land and pull sinners out of it like plants from the ground.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
